    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0832" n="720" xml:id="pg720"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum from Mexican Embassy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexican Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June 9,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Ambassador of Mexico has the honor to forward to the most excellent Mr. Knox,
                    Secretary of State, the appended note, to which he referred at to-day’s
                    interview, and begs leave to remind him that his excellency was pleased to offer
                    to send him the text of the draft of convention which is to serve as a basis for
                    the negotiations relative to El Chamizal.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
